# SHA-256 of the certificate that signs every released TMPlayer APK (CN=TMPlayer, OU=dev,
# O=dracu-lah), as `apksigner verify --print-certs` prints it. Public, not a secret: anyone can read
# it from a released APK. scripts/verify-apk-signer.sh checks an APK built outside the release
# workflow against it before that workflow publishes it. Read from v1.28.5 and v1.28.6-beta.3 on
# 2026-11-18. A key rotation changes it, on purpose and in a commit of its own.
